timeline
    title The Fracture Saga - ACT II - Chapters 5 to 7

    section Chapter 5 - Riftwaters Crossing
        TASK - Return to Kirn - Tracking Signal:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - velka ("The maps are shifting. Something is twisting the city's shape."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - drin ("My illusions are becoming real. It's that bracelet Kirn has."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - marlo_finch ("That bracelet is a ledger of collapse. I need to audit it."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - sylvi ("Looking for a way across the Riftwaters? Not many can make that journey."):
                Narrator - Chapter 5 - Life can only be understood backward... but it must be lived forward.:
            > COMPLETED:
                Kirn - You're back... good. I was hoping the signal wasn't a fluke. I placed a tracking sigil on the Bracelet of Existence. After the fracture, the sigil went dead... until now. It's faint, but it's there... and it's coming from somewhere across the Riftwaters. Velka can trace the signal with her maps. Go speak to her.:
                Moxie - A ghost signal waking up after everything went to hell? Now that's interesting. I wonder what else decided to come back online...:
                Chock - Across the Riftwaters, huh? Sounds like a pain in the ass already. But if that's where the bracelet is, then that's where we're going.:
                Kade - Great. Another unstable crossing. Just what we needed. At least we have a lead instead of wandering blind again.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - kirn ("Talk to Velka about following the tracking sigil, she knows things."):
                EVENT - award_task - meet_velka

        TASK - Meet Velka - Map of Signal Location:
            > ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired task):
            > COMPLETED:
                Velka - The world has changed more than you know. Continents have split, merged, and rewritten themselves. The signal you're chasing lies beyond the Riftwaters... storms that tear reality apart. I can give you the map of the signal's location, but teleportation is the only way to reach it. The seas are too unstable.:
                EVENT - award_item - tracking_map:
                Kaera - Then we must find someone who can cross storms without crossing the sea.:
                Kirn - Sylvi Emberlane might know someone.:
                Poise - Storms that tear reality apart... sounds like a warm-up.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - velka ("The signal is across the Riftwaters. You'll need more than a map to get there. Find Sylvi Emberlane."):
                EVENT - award_task - speak_to_sylvi_emberlane

        TASK - Meet Sylvi Emberlane - NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired task):
            > COMPLETED:
                Sylvi - Teleportation across the Riftwaters? Oh honey... that's not something you ask just anyone.:
                Syvli - But I might know someone who knows someone. There's a woman. A Riftcaller.:
                Sylvi - She doesn't walk through doors -- she walks through reflections. Name's Astra Wynn.:
                Sylvi - She won't talk to strangers. But she owes me a favor. Bring me my Stormglass Ember, and I'll call her.:
                Moxie - A reflection-walker? Now that sounds like real power. I’d love to see how that works.:
                Chock - Everything in this damn world is either trying to kill us, mess with our heads, or both. Starting to get real tired of it.:
                Sylvi - (laughs) That’s the spirit of the place, big guy. Keeps things interesting, doesn’t it?:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - sylvi ("Bring me my Stormglass Ember from Stormglass Alley, and I'll summon Astra Wynn for you."):
                EVENT - award_task - meet_static_wraiths

        TASK - Meet Static Wraiths - Item:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - create_npc - static_wraith (stormglass_alley):
                EVENT - create_dungeon - stormglass_alley (region_city_open_area):
            > COMPLETED:
                Chock - These bastards are damn annoying. Like angry lightbulbs that don’t know when to die.:
                Moxie - That humming… it’s completely off. Sets my teeth on edge. I really don’t like it.:
                Kade - Of course they hum. They’re literally made of static. What did you expect, opera?:
                Poise - Stay focused. They’re fast — don’t let them flank you.:
                EVENT - award_task - defeat_static_wraiths

        TASK - Defeat Static Wraiths - Item:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - begin_combat - static_wraith_mob (stormglass_alley):
            > COMPLETED:
                Chock - Finally. Those things were a real pain in the ass. Felt like fighting a swarm of pissed-off hornets made of lightning.:
                Moxie - Look at this… the Stormglass Ember. Still warm. You can feel the residual energy pulsing through it. Beautiful.:
                Kade - Yeah, beautiful. Just don’t drop it. Last thing we need is another reality-tearing accident because we broke the wrong shiny object.:
                Poise - It’s stable for now. We should get it back to Sylvi before anything else decides to crawl out of these alleys.:
                Chock - Agreed. I’ve had enough of this place.:
                EVENT - award_item - stormglass_ember:
                EVENT - award_task - return_to_sylvi

        TASK - Deliver Stormglass Ember to Sylvi - NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired task):
            > COMPLETED:
                Sylvi - You actually found it. Good. Try not to drop it -- it bites.:
                Narrator - Sylvi whispers into the ember. It fractures into mirrored shards. The air ripples.:
                Moxie - Ohhh that's pretty. Do it again.:
                Sylvi - If I do it again, reality might fold in half.:
                Moxie - ...Do it again.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - sylvi ("Astra Wynn will be here shortly. Don't wander off."):
                EVENT - remove_item - stormglass_ember:
                EVENT - award_task - meet_astra_wynn

        TASK - Meet Astra Wynn - Riftcaller NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - create_npc - astra_wynn (city_number_3_region_city_shopitems):
            > COMPLETED:
                Astra - Sylvi. You called.:
                Sylvi - They need a Riftcall. Across the Riftwaters.:
                Astra - Dangerous. Reckless. I like it. I can anchor to the signal you're chasing. No amplifiers needed -- but the jump won't be gentle.:
                Kade - Gentle hasn't been on the menu for a while.:
                Kaera - We trust your guidance.:
                Astra - Oh, don't. I barely trust myself.:
                Astra - Stand still. The Riftwaters distort identity. Try not to think about who you were. I will anchor you to the signal's echo. Where you land... depends on how well reality cooperates.:
                Moxie - Reality never cooperates. That's why it's fun.:
                Poise - Quiet your mind. Or at least try.:
                Narrator - The world folds. The sky bends. Reality snaps sideways.:
                EVENT - create_dungeon - rift_dungeon_outskirts (region_open_area):
                EVENT - set_player_in_dungeon - rift_dungeon_outskirts (final_chamber):
                Chock - Teleported straight into a fight. Figures.:
                Moxie - The rift welcomed us with open teeth.:
                Kade - I think my spine inverted for a second.:
                Kaera - Stay close. This place feels... wrong.:
                EVENT - show_npc - astra_wynn (city_number_5_region_city_shopitems):
                EVENT - award_task - meet_astra_wynn_go_back:
                EVENT - award_task - meet_dorian_pikefall

