        TASK - Meet Dorian Pikefall - Collector NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - create_npc - dorian_pikefall (region_city_shopitems):
            > COMPLETED:
                Dorian - Oh thank the stars! Actual people! You're not thieves, are you? Please tell me you're not here to rob me too...:
                Kade - Honestly, would we tell you if we were?:
                Dorian - I- I'm Dorian Pikefall. Collector. Traveler. Victim of extremely poor timing.:
                Moxie - He's cute when he's terrified.:
                Chock - He looks like he's always terrified.:
                Kaera - Please be gentle with him. He's clearly been through something.:
                Dorian - I had it... The Bracelet of Existence. I was transporting it for a client. Then it was stolen from me near the breach site. Some shimmering distortion... like a tear in the air. It just took it.:
                Poise - His pulse is erratic. He's telling the truth.:
                Dorian - The storms... they're getting worse. The sky cracked open last night. I heard voices in the thunder.:
                Kaera - The land cries out. Something is deeply wrong here.:
                Chock - Good. I was getting bored.:
                Moxie - Voices in the thunder? Ooooh, maybe they're hiring.:
                Kade - Or maybe it's the sound of the world dying. Again.:
                Poise - Stay alert. The air tastes wrong. Like metal and memory.:
                Dorian - If you're looking for answers about that bracelet... you should talk to Seth. He's usually at the bar in Bleakwatch Outpost. Sketchy type, but he knows things.:
                EVENT - award_item - dorians_sketch_of_distortion:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - dorian_pikefall - "I saw something strange near the breach site. A shimmering distortion carrying something that glowed like your bracelet. Seth at Bleakwatch Outpost might know more.":
                EVENT - advance_chapter
    
    section Chapter 6 - The Riftlands Unveiled
        TASK - Meet Seth - Resistance Contact NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - show_npc - seth (region_city_bar):
                Narrator - Chapter 6 - Life, left to itself, tends toward chaos... unless something holds it together.:
            > COMPLETED:
                Seth - Oh hey! You made it. Didn't think you'd get across the Riftwaters in one piece. Look... I didn't tell you everything. I'm part of a group. A resistance. We're trying to stop the collapse.:
                Chock - You doubted us? I'm offended.:
                Poise - You? In a resistance?:
                Seth - Yeah yeah, laugh it up. I'm useful sometimes.:
                Moxie - Define "useful.":
                Seth - ...I know people.:
                Kaera - Seth, if you're trying to help, we're grateful. Even if your methods are... unconventional.:
                Seth - See? Kaera gets it.:
                Chock - She's being polite. Don't get excited.:
                Seth - I have a contact who can help you investigate the breach. Meet him at the city outskirts bar.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - seth ("I have a contact who can help you investigate the breach. Meet him at the city outskirts bar."):
                EVENT - award_task - meet_seth_local_contact

        TASK - Meet Seth's Local Contact - NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                EVENT - create_npc - resistance_contact (region_bar):
            > COMPLETED:
                Contact - You're the outsiders Seth told me about. Good. We need hands. Something is stirring in the wilds. Something that's twisting the land.:
                Kade - Wonderful. More unstable terrain. Exactly what I wanted today.:
                Chock - Alright. Unstable ground means we stay sharp and move smart. Let’s get this done right.:
                Kaera - We should move carefully. Something here feels… off. Like the land itself is unsettled.:
                Contact - ...You people are strange.:
                Moxie - Thank you. We try.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - resistance_contact ("Clear the breach site. Something crawled out of it, and we need it stopped."):
                EVENT - award_task - meet_riftspawn_aberrant

