        TASK - Report Findings to Seth - NPC:
            > ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired task):
            > COMPLETED:
                Seth - So it's true... the Riftlands are destabilizing faster than we thought. And if the Bracelet of Existence is here... someone is using it.:
                Chock - Or wearing it as jewelry.:
                Kade - Or weaponizing it.:
                Poise - Or losing control of it.:
                Kaera - Whatever the case, we must find it.:
                Seth - Either way... we're gonna need my airship.:
                Chock - You have an airship?:
                Seth - ...Yes?:
                Moxie - Oh this is going to be FUN.:
                Seth - Alright, cards on the table. My crew and I? We're trying to stop the collapse. The rifts, the storms, the distortions... they're all connected.:
                Poise - We suspected as much. Patterns don't break themselves. Someone breaks them.:
                Moxie - Ooooh, a secret resistance? Seth, you should've led with that. I love a dramatic reveal.:
                Chock - Hah! I knew you were hiding something. You've got that shifty look.:
                Kaera - If your intentions are righteous, then we stand with you. But deception breeds danger.:
                Kade - Just tell us the plan before Chock punches the wrong person again.:
                Seth - The Riftlands are unstable. Too unstable. If we try to fly without stabilizing the region... the airship will tear itself apart.:
                Kade - So we fix the region. Great. Add "world maintenance" to our job list.:
                Moxie - If the airship explodes mid-flight, I call dibs on haunting Seth.:
                Seth - That Riftland Stabilizer Core looks like it may be useful in strengthing the Rustwing against these storms.  Let me take it off your hands to make a few upgrades.:
                Poise - A machine cannot run on broken parts. Neither can a world.:
                EVENT - remove_item - riftland_stabilizer_core:
                Seth - There are seven local resistance members. Each one holds things together in their local region. Help them, and the land stabilizes. Ignore them, and we all die horribly. You can find them in city outskirt bars.:
                Moxie - Motivating. Nothing like imminent doom to get the blood pumping.:
                Chock - Seven heroes? Sounds like seven fights. I'm in.:
                Kaera - These guardians must be under great strain. We should aid them swiftly.:
                Kade - Let's just hope they're competent. I'm tired of cleaning up after amateurs.:
                Seth - I'm not taking off until all seven are handled. You want to find that bracelet? Earn it.:
                Moxie - Ugh, homework. Fine.:
                Chock - Seven? Easy. I'll do eight just to show off.:
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - seth ("I'll prepare the airship. But we need to stabilize the region first."):
                EVENT - advance_chapter

